<title>USA: Norfolk Southern Corp Q1 net dropped.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Southern Corp Q1 net dropped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.02		    $1.31</p>
<p> Net			127,800		  168,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,249,700		1,215,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Per share down 22 pct, net income down 24 pct.</p>
<p>1997 net includes charge of $77.2 million for acquisition credit facility, equal to $49.7 million, or $0.40/shr, after taxes. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
